<h1 align="start" nodeId="a7a92aa9b9654d3a8b05a5f0bfccfb9f">5.常用冲突处理指南</h1>
<h2 align="start" nodeId="35bcb01e2004452b8181c475714f744e">5.1 规则组本体内冲突处理逻辑 </h2>
<h3 nodeId="025cf84d24a94b238b768bcc18d82e0a">原则一：同一规则组内不允许出现相同的“规则+决策”</h3>
<p nodeId="ab46c33427ea4e57bdd6598ac2af56d4"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/59203601/116557864777?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="662" height="329" nodeId="3efb870192d0419e8ff32acbfb4bdf94" /></p>
<h2 align="start" nodeId="d2cbd113f9374a50a287ba454707dddf">5.2 场景配置增改时冲突处理逻辑</h2>
<h3 align="start" nodeId="22d8d3cfdf8a41a1bba6819b32bec989">原则二：在场景配置增/改时，不允许出现相同的配置</h3>
<blockquote nodeId="68dfa50fe5e64f9c93eeda6939bdedf2">
<p nodeId="ef85788efd644514bbc1204c6e23b0c0">什么是相同的配置？即除状态外，其他内容完全一致的配置</p>
</blockquote>
<p nodeId="a12f86a976b5400fac3de8a30dda09d5"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/59203601/116717215840?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="667" height="362" nodeId="9be8c303d1c24b0891036d01d43bd7d1" /></p>
<h2 nodeId="9fa4361bebaa485dad2ceadee3d429b5">5.3 规则组更新时与场景冲突处理逻辑</h2>
<h3 nodeId="d447c0540b7c467b9f11834a37399467">原则三：同一普通场景的规则组内不允许出现相同的<span color="rgb(240, 94, 80)">标记/生效</span>的“规则+决策”</h3>
<blockquote nodeId="3cfb91489fd9464594942f9820038899">
<p nodeId="9da88b1b3b2f48aa81e7368251cd4be7">规则组在增改时，会自动同步至所有引用的场景内。同步时，普通场景会校验是否存在相同的<span color="rgb(240, 94, 80)">标记/生效态的策略，如果存在则将转为离线态同步进去。分层场景则默认按照规则本身的状态进行同步。</span></p>
</blockquote>
<p nodeId="f7f32ffcec4c4228881267ccc7342f7f"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/59203601/116716043233?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1469" height="372" nodeId="aa734c91e225464a875874d4e57ae0e7" /></p>
<h1 align="start" nodeId="420e65151f1e4696909dcb422910614f">6.规则组特性</h1>
<h2 align="start" nodeId="adc6fdc95eda4828ba88055afccbd149">6.1 规则组内规则增删改，引用该规则组的未失去联动（在6.2前提下的）的场景配置会同步增删改</h2>
<p nodeId="354b903a61cc4e24ba8def8f786416fa"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">特殊逻辑：删除时，分层场景内的失去联动的配置也会同步删除</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="eb8c989afcaf40bfbdc4847c6cd99a5f">1）测试规则组在测试场景中已应用</p>
